sentences.t:
Huic deus ipse loci fluvio Tiberinus amoeno
populeas inter senior se attollere frondes
visus;

sentences.l:
To him the god himself of the place, from his river, Tiberinus, his pleasant one,
among the poplar leaves, aged, himself to raise
seemed;

him, fine, in a grey-green was veiling robe
linen, and his hair shady was covering reed;
then thus to address him and his cares with these to take away words:
